{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/a1d7550fb3f1d5d6abe6ad1ca7004d4d.poster.avif?t=1770834134\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/a1d7550fb3f1d5d6abe6ad1ca7004d4d.webm?t=1770834134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/a1d7550fb3f1d5d6abe6ad1ca7004d4d.mp4?t=1770834134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find the red ball for one lonely cat!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/48b43f6db3de9b47e5d7b4e708dcb775.avif?t=1770834134\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cWhere's My Red Ball?\u201d is a point-and-click puzzle game about finding a hidden red ball for a cat.</strong> The red ball that the cat wants is hidden in a different way in every stage: sometimes it's in a box, sometimes it's pretending to be an apple! Solve witty and interesting puzzles to reach the hidden story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/b419fab7b45552fa2b4b01e74a8d683c.poster.avif?t=1770834134\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/b419fab7b45552fa2b4b01e74a8d683c.webm?t=1770834134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/b419fab7b45552fa2b4b01e74a8d683c.mp4?t=1770834134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/adab721fdc5789fda5e304db0f0e175b.avif?t=1770834134\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cat that is always sad and lonely needs a red ball to be happy. And the cat is very picky: if the ball is dirty, dented, or slightly undersized, it will never satisfy the cat. We need to find the one and only red ball that the cat wants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But can we find the right red ball every time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/4c708ae6bd4734456260b2a0b462d5ec.poster.avif?t=1770834134\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/4c708ae6bd4734456260b2a0b462d5ec.webm?t=1770834134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/4c708ae6bd4734456260b2a0b462d5ec.mp4?t=1770834134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/a77056cb05a764d8b0288db60cb5971c.avif?t=1770834134\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does a cat keep crying? Why does the cat want the red ball? Uncover the cat's hidden story with the fragments of memory you'll find as you solve the puzzles. As you solve the stages, you'll get a glimpse into the cat's memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What really happened to the cat?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.stea