ck puzzle game about finding a hidden red ball for a cat.</strong> The red ball that the cat wants is hidden in a different way in every stage: sometimes it's in a box, sometimes it's pretending to be an apple! Solve witty and interesting puzzles to reach the hidden story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/b419fab7b45552fa2b4b01e74a8d683c.poster.avif?t=1770834134\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/b419fab7b45552fa2b4b01e74a8d683c.webm?t=1770834134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/b419fab7b45552fa2b4b01e74a8d683c.mp4?t=1770834134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/adab721fdc5789fda5e304db0f0e175b.avif?t=1770834134\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cat that is always sad and lonely needs a red ball to be happy. And the cat is very picky: if the ball is dirty, dented, or slightly undersized, it will never satisfy the cat. We need to find the one and only red ball that the cat wants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But can we find the right red ball every time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/4c708ae6bd4734456260b2a0b462d5ec.poster.avif?t=1770834134\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906090/extras/4c708ae6bd4734456260b2a0b462d5ec.webm?t=1770834